            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-how-it-works",
            "title": "How this program works",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How this program works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_5}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_5}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-181\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Six weeks with the same small group all the way through. Everyone starts and finishes together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What a week looks like</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The call</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Ninety minutes, same time every week</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The recording</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Posted the following day</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Between calls</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">One worksheet, and one thing you've committed to</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The group</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Open all week for questions and progress</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The call dates</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Week</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Call</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Theme</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">1</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 20 August, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Getting clear</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">2</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 27 August, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Making it real</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">3</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 3 September, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">When it gets hard</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">4</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 10 September, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Building the system</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">5</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 17 September, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Making it stick</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">6</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Thursday 24 September, 7pm</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Where you go next</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Google Calendar embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this embed</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal can show anything with an embed code inside a content page. This one is a Google Calendar. A booking page, a Google Sheet or a Loom recording work the same way.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we ask of you</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn up, do what you said you'd do, and tell the group whether you did it. Saying it in front of other people is a big part of why this works.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>We keep the groups small so everyone gets time to talk.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If you miss a call</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch the recording and post your commitment in the group before the next call. Missing one is fine, as long as you don't go quiet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-how-it-works",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-before-first-call",
            "title": "Before the first call",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the first call</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two things before we start. Neither takes long.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- Paste the Tally embed code here -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About this form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Client Portal works with any form tool that gives you an embed code. This one is built in Tally, but Gravity Forms, Typeform, Google Forms or whatever you already use works the same way. Paste the embed code into a content page and the form shows here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The form asks the three questions below and nothing else.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Answer these three questions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What do you want to be different by the end of the six weeks?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What have you already tried, and what happened?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's most likely to get in the way?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short answers are fine. Nobody sees these but me.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\" />\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get yourself set up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Put the call in your calendar as a repeating event</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Join the group space so you can post between calls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Find somewhere to keep notes, paper or otherwise</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-before-first-call",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-week-1",
            "title": "Week 1: Getting clear",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 1: Getting clear</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_6}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/video-embed-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1111\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The goal you arrive with is often one you picked up from somebody else. Check whose it is.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>One sentence forces a decision. If it takes a paragraph, there's more than one goal in there.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Vague goals feel safer because you can't fail them. They also don't go anywhere.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Saying it to the group makes it harder to quietly drop.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write your outcome in one sentence, no hedging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Post it in the group before Thursday</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Read it out on the next call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 1 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The one-sentence goal, written up</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-week-1",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-week-2",
            "title": "Week 2: Making it real",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 2: Making it real</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_6}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/video-embed-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1111\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A goal with no next action gets pushed back every time the week gets busy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pick three things. Anything past three can wait until next month.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If you can't put a date on it, it isn't specific enough yet.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Make the first action small enough that you'll do it even on a bad day.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Break your outcome into the three things that have to happen first</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Put a date against each one</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Do the first before the next call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 2 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Planning template</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-week-2",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-week-3",
            "title": "Week 3: When it gets hard",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Week 3: When it gets hard</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_6}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":{\"topLeft\":\"8px\",\"topRight\":\"8px\",\"bottomLeft\":\"8px\",\"bottomRight\":\"8px\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://wordpress.test/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/video-embed-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1111\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px;border-bottom-left-radius:8px;border-bottom-right-radius:8px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The novelty tends to run out around week three. It doesn't mean anything has gone wrong.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What stops you is rarely what you'd have guessed in advance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A small number of situations usually account for most of the avoidance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noticing the pattern helps more than trying harder.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before next week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Note the moments you avoid the work this week</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bring one pattern to the call</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pick one small change that interrupts it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Week 3 worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Avoidance tracker</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-week-3",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-recommended-tools",
            "title": "Recommended tools",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recommended tools</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of this is required. It's what people on past groups ended up using. All of them have a free tier.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Keeping notes</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_7}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_7}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1791\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Somewhere to think on paper between calls. One page per week works well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://notion.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">notion.so</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_8}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_8}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1796\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A shared document you can write in during the call. Easy to share with the group if you want feedback.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">docs.google.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Tracking the work</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_9}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_9}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1790\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A list of the three things and their dates. Tick them off as you go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://asana.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">asana.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_10}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_10}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1795\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shows where the hours went. Useful when the answer to what got in the way is that you're not sure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://toggl.com/track/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">toggl.com/track</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Protecting the time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_11}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_11}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1797\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Block the hour as a repeating event before anything else gets to it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://calendar.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">calendar.google.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"right\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:16px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:20px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":\"{{attachment:content_12}}\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img src=\"{{attachment_url:content_12}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1793\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If other people book your time, set your availability so they can't book over the block.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://calendly.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">calendly.com</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You don't need all of these</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pick one from each category. A paper notebook and a wall calendar do the same job if that's what you'll use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-recommended-tools",
            "meta": []
        },
        {
            "ref_slug": "group-coaching-gc-common-questions",
            "title": "Common questions",
            "post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Common questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The things people ask most in the first couple of weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I miss a call?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watch the recording and post your commitment in the group before the next one. Recordings go up the day after each call.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Are the calls recorded?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, all of them. If you'd rather not be on the recording, keep your camera off and use the chat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I ask questions between calls?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, in the group space. Someone else in the group will often answer before I get to it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if I fall behind?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come to the call anyway. Falling behind is normal, and it's easier to catch up if you keep turning up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Is what I share confidential?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. What's said on a call stays in the group, and we ask everyone to keep to that.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens at the end?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You keep the recordings and the worksheets. If you want to carry on, there are a couple of options in Resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not covered here? Ask in the group and someone will pick it up.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "post_name": "group-coaching-gc-common-questions",
            "meta": []
        }
